msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_5351814B_5466_4814_92DD_53303F78A75E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Before long, winter retreated and our second spring came "
"to take its place."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Peu après, l’hiver se retira et laissa la place à notre "
"second printemps."

#: scenario5:scenario5_435A89A1_6490_46EC_B689_8B258E374994
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d03ac22c1c6e7b53492f23c40ab994a05f5fa8d815c6bc059583057970144cbe
