#: scenario5:scenario5_286B7D41_1DBD_4963_8BB6_40E7871B4AEC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f0d8a177fed61f5164d7b0b5bcfd792721b98000be26faee2c1194868af6b556
