msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Les roses font de magnifiques cadeaux, paraît-il."

#: scenario5:scenario5_B595E7DD_16E6_4193_8F62_1AA39B0F2F5E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1f6c93e5a1d9a0eebe46b6b4cbad4ae3b3076609f4110a49e2d68dffe6947edc
