msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫No... ⟪k:1⟫that’s not what I meant. ⟪k:2⟫Why ⟪k:3⟫me⟪k:4⟫?⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫I haven’t given you "
"anything..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Non... ⟪k:1⟫ce n’est pas ce que je voulais dire. ⟪k:2⟫Pourquoi ⟪k:3⟫moi⟪k:4⟫ ?⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Je "
"ne vous ai rien offert..."

#: scenario5:scenario5_98B059F8_2C14_45D6_A5F8_BA68EBCD10C8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 821dd35d61cbc68ed51a4aa38ee799b22d84bfc9439cef408bd612cb8fe6f245
#. default-sha256: 0d36ee933cb27c42434e47192c5cf53c33fd4af34ffe8bc35cfc0156511a7fc5
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_98B059F8_2C14_45D6_A5F8_BA68EBCD10C8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Consider it... ⟪k:1⟫a symbol of my hope that we’ll still be this close another year from "
"now. ⟪k:2⟫If we are, then this is yours."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Voyez-le... ⟪k:1⟫comme un symbole de mon espoir que dans un an nous serons toujours aussi "
"proches. ⟪k:2⟫Si c’est le cas, alors ce sera à vous."

#: scenario5:scenario5_1BCBC943_BC9D_4727_AB28_372BA1BDAF2C
